sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CI
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as spark-operator-webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as spark-operator-controller<br/>8080/TCP metrics
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet<br/>10250/TCP HTTPS
    participant Driver as Spark Driver Pod<br/>7078/TCP RPC
    participant Executor as Spark Executor Pods

    Note over User,Executor: Flow 1: SparkApplication Submission

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply SparkApplication<br/>Auth: User credentials
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-sparkoperator-k8s-io-v1beta2-sparkapplication<br/>HTTPS/9443 TLS<br/>Auth: Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated SparkApplication<br/>(defaults applied)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-sparkoperator-k8s-io-v1beta2-sparkapplication<br/>HTTPS/9443 TLS
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: GET resourcequotas<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Webhook: ResourceQuota data
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: SparkApplication created

    Note over Controller,Executor: Controller Reconciliation

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: SparkApplication created<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create driver Pod spec<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate--v1-pod<br/>HTTPS/9443 TLS<br/>(injects volumes, env, labels)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated Pod
    K8sAPI->>Kubelet: Schedule driver Pod<br/>HTTPS/10250 TLS
    Kubelet-->>K8sAPI: Pod Running

    Note over Driver,Executor: Spark Runtime

    Driver->>Executor: Launch executors<br/>RPC/7078 TCP
    Executor-->>Driver: Registration<br/>Block Manager/7079 TCP
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Spark UI Service<br/>(port 4040/TCP)

    Note over User,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Module Controller Lifecycle

    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator
    participant ModCtrl as Module Controller<br/>8081/TCP health

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create SparkOperator CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI->>ModCtrl: Watch event: SparkOperator created
    ModCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployments, CRDs,<br/>RBAC, Services, Webhooks<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
